From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian Butterworth <i.r.butterworth@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:06:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] [SLP] Reset only the current region's scheduling data

resetSchedule, and the dependency reset in tryScheduleBundle when the
region grows downward, looped over every ScheduleData the block has ever
had and skipped those outside the current region. In a block with many
vectorizable trees this is linear in the block for each tree. Keep the
ScheduleData of the current region in a list and loop over that instead.

The resetSchedule part is from llvm/llvm-project#233866 (Alexey Bataev),
without its other scheduling changes or the higher budget. No change in
the generated code.

Assisted-by: Claude Code (Opus 5.5)
